From 7525bc050a6ce917173a0399a5042980f90dce55 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Diego Pivoto <>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 17:06:24 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] feat(nr-mac): enforce per-slice downlink PRB quota

Look up the slice quota for every DL candidate after collection and cap the
new-data allocation of the proportional-fair policy to it; HARQ
retransmissions keep their size and are counted as quota bypasses. Adds a
counter-free peek for readback, a MALFORMED status for the E2 adapter, and
nr_dlbench -Q/-q options with CTest scenarios for 24/52/78/106 PRBs and the
retransmission bypass.
---
